# libpdx-schema-registry — deps.list
#
# Shared-library dependencies consumed at link/load time. Format is one
# `<name> <version-constraint>` per line; blank lines and lines starting
# with `#` are comments.
#
# libpdx-schema-registry is the client-side facade for the (monorepo-
# side) svc.schema-registry daemon. At M2 it is a LEAF: no cross-library
# calls, no syscall. M3 layers in three sibling libraries (see below);
# the M2 API surface stands on its own for a consumer that only needs
# an in-process schema catalog.
#
# See paideia-os → design/round-retrospectives/r90-xrepo-wave3-plan.md
# §4 for the R90-XREPO.012 wave plan; declared deps land per-milestone:
#
#   M2                  — no cross-library deps.
#   M3-001 (this add)   — libpdx-audit  (>= 1.0.0, < 2.0.0) — record_state
#                          read for the D3 / I5 register gate.
#   M3-002              — libpdx-elevate (>= 1.0.0, < 2.0.0) — grant
#                          minted before schema_registry_arm.
#   M3-003              — libpdx-semantic-pipe (>= 1.0.0, < 2.0.0) —
#                          Send/Recv/Framing for the wire path to the
#                          kernel daemon.

libpdx-audit >= 1.0.0, < 2.0.0
